The EZVIZ W3 is a Gigabit WiFi AC Router (2.4 & 5Ghz), with an advertized combined WLAN speed of 1266Mbps. There seem to be different model numbers the EZVIZ W3 (see the labels on [[https://fccid.io/2APV2-W3/Label/Label-3966701|fccid.io]]), this page is specifically about the CS-W3-WD1200G EUP model. The label does not contain additional version information, other than 'EUP'.


